# Blackbox Subsystem Specification
File: blackbox/.docs/INDEX.oot

The blackbox subsystem provides execution flight recording, crash telemetry,
and compiler AST diffing for openOODA.

## Principles

1. Zero Ambient Authority: telemetry uses explicit ProcessCap.
2. Zero Heap on Crash: crash sensor writes via stack buffer without memory allocation.
3. 1-Turn Agent Diagnosis: compact autopsy reports designed for LLM harnesses.
